// GoFlow broker protocol — v1.
//
// Transport contract between the GoFlow broker and any client (Go,
// Python, JS, …). The server never executes job work; clients open a
// Consume stream, receive JobDelivery frames with a lease, and send
// Ack / Nack frames back up the same stream.
